Package: bsvarPost
Type: Package
Title: Posterior Analysis for 'bsvars' and 'bsvarSIGNs'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("David", "Zenz", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "office@davidzenz.com")
Description: Provides procedures for posterior analysis of Bayesian Structural
    Vector Autoregressions estimated with the 'bsvars' and 'bsvarSIGNs'
    packages. The package computes posterior summaries of impulse responses,
    cumulative dynamic multipliers, forecast error variance decompositions,
    historical decompositions, structural shocks, and forecasts. It facilitates
    comparison of posterior quantities across model specifications, evaluates
    pointwise and joint posterior hypotheses, selects representative posterior
    draws, and summarises response magnitudes and timing. Further procedures
    report restriction and acceptance diagnostics for sign-restricted models
    and visualise posterior results. The package aligns with the posterior
    objects returned by 'bsvars' and 'bsvarSIGNs'.
